    "incompatible_substitutions": [
      "Do not call the complement of viewerPercentage a measured count or share of unique unregistered human users worldwide.",
      "Do not treat direct or unknown traffic as entirely signed-out traffic.",
      "Do not equate signed-out watch events with new viewers or potential customer records.",
      "Do not sum owner channel unique viewers to obtain world-wide deduplicated users.",
      "Do not treat logged-in viewer percentage as platform user registration prevalence.",
      "Do not combine subscriber account counts with co-viewed or playback-start counts as one population."
